        <mxCell id="n_footer" value="The real scaling axis for ingestion is document-upload burst size, not employee count &#8212; a bulk policy-refresh event (open enrollment) is the real stress case, not daily traffic. Two real operational gaps (CI placeholder, dead Lambda) matter more right now than any new scale infrastructure." style="text;html=1;fontColor=#595959;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
